    "summary": "**[Feed the Swarm](vsdata:ability/tyranids.assimilation-swarm.feed-the-swarm)** lets each **HARVESTER** choose a friendly **TYRANIDS** unit to regenerate in your [Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase). The unit must be at most 6″ away and can benefit only once per phase. Either restore D3+1 lost wounds to a single model or bring back one slain **INFANTRY** model other than a **CHARACTER**. An **ENDLESS MULTITUDE** unit can bring back as many as 3 slain models in place of one.",
